{"c":[{"name":"20261009T094824Z-f579be04c067ac3a","text":"caret-heavy prune deletes inputs/vm-job/runs (the whole guest evidence); copy the run directory out before pruning an r2-vm job.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T105413Z-5b58229438c03538","text":"Ask has one maker (heads). Tests needing a stated intent use HelperOptions.ask {maker:'scripted'} (page-rig.ts scriptedIntent); heads never gives scope 'all', so page kind 'all' and next-page carry only arise from a scripted intent.","type":"note"}]}
